      "id": "H7I7bEW4xSK90dYaklTMQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1352.6389082094202,
      "y": 7412.891222055913,
      "width": 687.7796020507812,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 149797119,
      "version": 1386,
      "versionNonce": 1275689573,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791011101616,
      "created": 1790004789766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ATM LLD\n\nFunctional Requirements:\n\n1 - Authenticate users using card and pin.\n2 - Support withdraw, deposit and inquiy transaction type.\n3 - Dispense amount from denominations 100, 50, 20, 10 in that order.\n4 - Handle cases where atm, user does not have sufficient balance.\n5 - Track atm states: card inserted, idle, authenticated  .\n\nNon Functional Requirements:\n\n1 - Extensible, modular system.\n2 - Thread safety.\n3 - Maintainable and Testable.\n4 - Follows OOPs principles.\n5 - Follows validation before commit.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ATM LLD\n\nFunctional Requirements:\n\n1 - Authenticate users using card and pin.\n2 - Support withdraw, deposit and inquiy transaction type.\n3 - Dispense amount from denominations 100, 50, 20, 10 in that order.\n4 - Handle cases where atm, user does not have sufficient balance.\n5 - Track atm states: card inserted, idle, authenticated  .\n\nNon Functional Requirements:\n\n1 - Extensible, modular system.\n2 - Thread safety.\n3 - Maintainable and Testable.\n4 - Follows OOPs principles.\n5 - Follows validation before commit.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GUHjiclsHSb1PP7mB-1qI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -466.81201536590095,
      "y": 7417.676130772446,
      "width": 602.2196044921875,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
